udiv12: x / 12, for x from 0 to 999. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-23, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-23 to where the program needs x / 12, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 12 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 14 cells. It runs 14 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-23: (833x - 100) / 10^4 by signed digits (3, 3, -2, 1), the -1 from cell 00; right for x >= 0 only
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     290      ADD 90
 13     401      SFT 01
 14     290      ADD 90
 15     290      ADD 90
 16     290      ADD 90
 17     401      SFT 01
 18     790      SUB 90
 19     790      SUB 90
 20     700      SUB 00
 21     401      SFT 01
 22     290      ADD 90
 23     401      SFT 01
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
